{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2021-06-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'SALESFORCE POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN 2021 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR MULTICHANNEL MARKETING HUBS', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO, JUNE 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SALESFORCE (NYSE: CRM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SALESFORCE HAS BEEN POSITIONED BY GARTNER\xa0AS A LEADER IN ITS 2021 MAGIC QUADRANT FOR MULTICHANNEL MARKETING HUBS. SALESFORCE WAS EVALUATED FOR ITS SALESFORCE MARKETING CLOUD.'}